# handheld_pc conventions

- Scope: SteamOS / Linux handheld tools and fixes only.
- Put work under `devices/<device>/fixes/<fix-name>/`.
- Prefer stock SteamOS + tiny overlays (especially udev). Avoid custom InputPlumber binaries unless documented in that fix's `KNOWLEDGE.md`.
- Do not invent cleanups or uninstallers unless the user asks.
- When diagnosing Legion Go 2 gyro, read `devices/legion-go-2/fixes/gyroscope-imu-udev/KNOWLEDGE.md` first.
